      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þæt is ðonne æryst, þæt ic wylle þæt man rihte lage up arǽre ⁊ æghwylce unlage georne afylle, þæt man awéodige ⁊ awyrtwalie æghwylc unriht, swa man geornost mæge, of [ð]issum earde ⁊ arǽre up Godes riht.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The first provision is, that I desire that justice be promoted and every injustice zealously suppressed, that every illegality be rooted up and eradicated from this land with the utmost diligence, and the law of God promoted.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is þonne ærest, þæt ic wylle, þæt man rihte laga upp arære ⁊ æghwylce unlaga georne afylle, ⁊ þæt man áweodige ⁊ awyrtwalige æghwylc unriht, swa man geornost mæge, of þysum earde, ⁊ arære up Godes riht;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
